cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222555010:0":{"text":"哼~就像捉鱼那样？","source_cn":"哼~就像捉鱼那样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E715306FA45CD62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222555011:0":{"text":"我有个想法。塔西，你说过哈拉克一上岛就直奔流金之地，对吧？是不是有点奇怪？","source_cn":"我有个想法。塔西，你说过哈拉克一上岛就直奔流金之地，对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F0C68474F0680CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222555012:1":{"text":"对呀，明明流金之地隐蔽在湖下，岛上也有很多活物，他为什么会直奔洞里的宝物堆呢？","source_cn":"对呀，明明流金之地隐蔽在湖下，岛上也有很多活物，他为什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF4884F1B51EF165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1222555012":{"text":"对呀，明明流金之地隐蔽在湖下，岛上也有很多活物，他为什么会直奔洞里的宝物堆呢？","source_cn":"对呀，明明藏宝之地隐蔽在湖下，岛上也有很多活物，他为什么会直奔洞里的宝物堆呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF4884F1B51EF165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222555013:0":{"text":"当然。特勒米琉斯把剑留下之后，偶尔会有人因为意外漂流登岛。","source_cn":"当然。特勒米琉斯把剑留下之后，偶尔会有人因为意外漂流登岛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53145507B822933A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:122255501